candela is a fork of keel (https://github.com/horacehoff/keel) by Horace Hoff.

Original work licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Renamed and extended for the Lumen UI framework.

The original keel copyright and Apache-2.0 license terms are retained in
full in the LICENSE file. All original authorship by Horace Hoff is
preserved. Modifications include a host-embeddable Engine/Program API,
variadic host functions, array/map marshalling across the host boundary,
structured diagnostics, and the rename of the language and crate to
candela (source file extension: .cdl).
